(This audit uses Aegis AI, a stacking ensemble \(Random Forest, XGBoost, LightGBM\) trained on millions of) Tj
T* (network flows. The system analyzes network flow metadata to classify traffic into 13 categories including DDoS,) Tj
T* (port scanning, brute-force attempts, and web application attacks. Scope: this analysis covers network-layer traffic) Tj
T* (patterns only. It does not include endpoint security, application code review, or physical security assessment.) Tj
T* (Results reflect a point-in-time analysis of the submitted data.) Tj
